Hi,

I am working on getting it back on CRAN - although this might take a bit as I can no longer see whatever FORTRAN compiler issue led  them to take it off CRAN.

But -- the June 2023 archives of rexpokit were done on R 4.3.1, so it's not a R-Version-4 problem.  This error:

"‘rexpokit’ was installed before R 4.0.0: please re-install it".

...suggests to me that you still have an old version installed, that was installed back when you were running some R 3.x version.  So, probably, you would have to uninstall the old rexpokit installation with e.g.:

remove.packages("rexpokit")

...before installing a new one.

Cheers,
Nick

